==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|refusell}}; equivalent to {{suf|en|refuse|al}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{enPR|rĭfyo͞ozʹəl}}, {{IPA|en|/ɹɪˈfjuːzl̩/}}
* {{rhymes|en|uːzəl|s=3}}
* {{audio|en|en-us-refusal.ogg|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# The act of [[refusing]].
#: {{ux|en|Your '''refusal''' to carry out your duties resulted in your sacking.}}
# {{lb|en|[[civil engineering]]}} Depth or point at which well or [[borehole]] [[drilling]] cannot continue.

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|act of refusing}} {{l|en|repudiation}}, {{l|en|abnegation}}, {{l|en|declination}}

